From 83be7322cd95baa1bffb0c71b1284d5747d44c08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:09:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(od-sevev): walk the old leader out on the old stage
 and lift an empty ceremony card
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Manual test 2026-09-30 A4 and A5. The EVOLVE_TX card lifted over the ticker with its lines
still printing (two texts overlapping), and the old leader walked out across the next era's
stage. Now, when a pick follows, the walk-out is the ceremony's f0 on the old stage
(leadMs = the 560 ms walk + an 80 ms empty beat; reduced motion 150 + 80), the card dims in
over the empty stage, the seam swaps the state and the stage under the fully opaque page,
and the lines step out (40 ms steps) before the page lifts empty. Dubi's pending pick line
is dropped at the confirm, and the trick cue never plays the crit on a walked-off figure.
LeaderWalk stays driven by BigBanana._apply_figure. The state graph §9 gets revision 2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UJWVH11egMQ4r4GfyoMb4p
