From 06d3fc2cbc141a37c1adeea9a19ca0d57e46c4b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:09:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(od-sevev): give every election its leader's story
 card and lint the cards for reported speech
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Manual test 2026-09-30 B15. All 8 roster leaders already get their own flash after an
election (Story.flash by their own election count); the T4 story archive still replayed
Bibi's beats for every election, so it now rebuilds each card from story_seen
(Story.archive, newest first, headed by the card title and the leader). The content lint
gains §6b: on every story card a quote may only be in the narrator's mouth, and no line
puts words in a real person's mouth ("X ענה:"). Three lines move to reported speech: the
office's "no hat", "ביבי לא חשוד", and Bennett's second-place answer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UJWVH11egMQ4r4GfyoMb4p
